abstract: >-
  AITIR Version 2.0 is a vendor-neutral reference architecture for converting
  identity-centered security telemetry into provenance-linked evidence, a
  bounded policy decision, an authorized response, and independently
  reviewable assurance. The repository provides documentation, schemas,
  synthetic examples, validation, and research provenance; it is not a
  production implementation or certification.
